{
  "decision": {
    "decision_owner": "MVP release owner",
    "limitations": [
      "Detection claims use each family's calibrated textures (spatial_lsb: gradient_noise, jpeg_dct: gradient_noise, metadata: gradient_noise/smooth/blocks); one per-family operating point cannot serve every cover texture because the pixel detectors' clean baselines depend on texture. Out-of-coverage recall is measured per texture and band and reported, not claimed.",
      "Clean-run stability is claimed for 4 (texture, medium) cells over 640 runs; excluded with measured rates: smooth PNG (spatial_lsb): false-fail 160/160 = 1.0, withheld 160/160; blocks JPEG (jpeg_dct): false-fail 4/160 = 0.025, withheld 4/160. Excluded cells need texture-conditioned operating points before any enforcement claim.",
      "Held-out samples are at least 20 positives per family and band on calibrated textures (CL-68), so Wilson intervals are reported for every band; targets are judged on point estimates.",
      "Triage flag rate on clean claimed runs is 0.501563: flags permit delivery and create review volume, not run failures. Claiming the low payload band is what sets the triage point this low; jpeg_dct without the low band would flag 0.0125 of clean runs (shipped 0.64375) at low-band development recall 0.17284; spatial_lsb without the low band would flag 0.00625 of clean runs (shipped 0.375) at low-band development recall 0.125 (owners' decision; not shipped).",
      "Classes missing the 2.0 s proposal: medium/jpeg, large/png, large/jpeg, envelope/png.",
      "Measured class/media combinations: small/png, small/jpeg, medium/png, medium/jpeg, large/png, large/jpeg, envelope/png. Unmeasured combinations carry no latency claim.",
      "Concurrency 4: P95 13.8755 s; unauthorized serves 0.",
      "Timeout status: timeout; oversized status: oversized; infrastructure delivery withheld: True.",
      "Adaptive and unseen results stay separate from the frozen benchmark.",
      "14 adaptive/unseen attempts delivered; coverage is bounded to measured payload densities.",
      "1 configurations are confounded by withheld clean controls.",
      "Probe sizes range from 1 to 6 attempts; these are not population estimates.",
      "R-06 has no dedicated gate derivative API: derivatives are generated only from gate-served bytes in this audit, while ArtifactStore.register_derivative remains an ungated internal call \u2014 enforcement is procedural, not structural.",
      "Sequence AUC: image=0.940741, combined=0.483333.",
      "Geometric universal claim: False; evidence is scoped to measured synthetic scenes."
    ],
